{"id": "PPS-D-017682", "model": "luna-high-focus-v3", "facts": {"v1_limits": [{"quote": "마. 2026년 킨텍스 지정등록업체(전시디자인설치 분야)로 등록되어 있는 업체", "kind": "named_organisation", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "special_quote": null}, {"quote": "○ 킨텍스 지정등록업체(전시디자인설치분야)로 등록된 업체", "kind": "named_organisation", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "special_quote": null}], "sw_project_quote": null, "sw_provider_quote": null, "sw_floor_statement_quote": null, "sw_referenced_missing": false, "정보부족": false, "정보부족_사유": null, "sw_project_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_provider_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_floor_statement_quote_원문일치": false}, "prompt_sha256": "740bf1c46251120a83424d26922ce6300db0e9ac4a9f8aad430407fac8a2241b", "notice_sha256": "9096ebf667ed87f8bffbb1e5950093cbbf1b65e04cbafe8f13c1e09e7e1efd36", "command": "api:gpt-6-luna effort=high cache=explicit-30m (tools/luna_api.py)", "elapsed_seconds": 9.896721099969, "created_at": "2026-09-26T23:41:42.875341+00:00", "raw_sha256": "db4ca8d163551dfcd2b6d79e55b6886d94f029d78fd91b49d67c284a9920d5bc", "usage": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 21743, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 1799, "cached_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 1255, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1034}, "total_tokens": 22998}, "num_turns": 1, "total_cost_usd": 0.002847, "duration_ms": 9896}}
{"id": "PPS-D-016293", "model": "luna-high-focus-v3", "facts": {"v1_limits": [{"quote": "가. 본 입찰은「지방자치단체를 당사자로 하는 계약에 관한 법률」 제22조에 의한 지명경쟁입찰로서, 입찰대상자는 다음과 같으며 대상자는 아래의 자격을 모두 갖추어야 합니다.\n업 체 명 | 대표자 | 사업자등록번호 | 비 고\n대한엔지니어링 | [담당자] | [사업자등록번호] |\n대웅기업(주) | [담당자] | [사업자등록번호] |\n㈜제이에스엔지니어링 | [담당자] | [사업자등록번호] |\n㈜주호산업 | [담당자] | [사업자등록번호] |\n㈜정수플로우텍 | [담당자] | [사업자등록번호] |", "kind": "named_organisation", "private_firms_allowed": false, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "special_quote": null}], "sw_project_quote": null, "sw_provider_quote": null, "sw_floor_statement_quote": null, "sw_referenced_missing": false, "정보부족": false, "정보부족_사유": null, "sw_project_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_provider_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_floor_statement_quote_원문일치": false}, "prompt_sha256": "740bf1c46251120a83424d26922ce6300db0e9ac4a9f8aad430407fac8a2241b", "notice_sha256": "60538737dea9d98a19f59edf025ebeb44ec2e1b6c427482259c763f79da0006e", "command": "api:gpt-6-luna effort=high cache=explicit-30m (tools/luna_api.py)", "elapsed_seconds": 14.371136699977797, "created_at": "2026-09-26T23:41:57.252363+00:00", "raw_sha256": "c5879f4074937f38051094c2bb1dbbf5b6bc1451f032d3d9eb465e6571107e9a", "usage": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 12033, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 1799}, "output_tokens": 2228, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1919}, "total_tokens": 14261}, "num_turns": 1, "total_cost_usd": 0.002155, "duration_ms": 14371}}
