{"id": "PPS-D-007998", "model": "luna-high-focus-v3", "facts": {"v1_limits": [{"quote": "국내 HACCP지정업체이어야 하며", "kind": "institution_type", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "special_quote": null}, {"quote": "마. 농․수․축산물 식잡 도․소매 사업허가를 득하고 당해 입찰 목적물의 운반에 필요한 차량(보․냉탑차)시설을 보유 또는 임차하고 있는 자 (차량 내부온도를 확인 할 수 있는 온도계 비치)", "kind": "facility_equipment_staff", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": "바. 계약자(낙찰자)는 6개교의 일일 납품지시서에 따라 각 학교별로 급식물품을 납품하여야 하며 또한 견적서, 납품서, 계산서를 각각 제출하여야 합니다.", "special_quote": null}], "sw_project_quote": null, "sw_provider_quote": null, "sw_floor_statement_quote": null, "sw_referenced_missing": false, "정보부족": false, "정보부족_사유": null, "sw_project_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_provider_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_floor_statement_quote_원문일치": false}, "prompt_sha256": "740bf1c46251120a83424d26922ce6300db0e9ac4a9f8aad430407fac8a2241b", "notice_sha256": "7331981df48d6a4846a03228fbb0f3906c9918c62c3ac20db779865e5dc9443b", "command": "api:gpt-6-luna effort=high cache=explicit-30m (tools/luna_api.py)", "elapsed_seconds": 35.98602369998116, "created_at": "2026-09-26T23:44:04.914669+00:00", "raw_sha256": "83a751eb187e7e882ba10a151c80e519625d587b167bcb39f2740c12e56994d5", "usage": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 5682, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 1799}, "output_tokens": 5303, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5047}, "total_tokens": 10985}, "num_turns": 1, "total_cost_usd": 0.003058, "duration_ms": 35985}}
{"id": "PPS-D-019072", "model": "luna-high-focus-v3", "facts": {"v1_limits": [{"quote": "〇 식자재 납품업체는 식재료 보관에 적합한 물류창고를 소유하거나 임차하여 운영(보유)함으로써 식재료를 납품해야 한다.", "kind": "facility_equipment_staff", "private_firms_allowed": true, "statute_quote": null, "need_quote": null, "special_quote": null}], "sw_project_quote": null, "sw_provider_quote": null, "sw_floor_statement_quote": null, "sw_referenced_missing": false, "정보부족": false, "정보부족_사유": null, "sw_project_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_provider_quote_원문일치": false, "sw_floor_statement_quote_원문일치": false}, "prompt_sha256": "740bf1c46251120a83424d26922ce6300db0e9ac4a9f8aad430407fac8a2241b", "notice_sha256": "d9bc9a97c0098495d586d92d21a62f651208238dbe759eaf6d9516200c98a3f0", "command": "api:gpt-6-luna effort=high cache=explicit-30m (tools/luna_api.py)", "elapsed_seconds": 18.396218799985945, "created_at": "2026-09-26T23:44:23.317717+00:00", "raw_sha256": "3dba8807eb73360474110bc3ee5135cb592239fb8988664d458d288e3d8908ff", "usage": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 12475, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 1799}, "output_tokens": 2573, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2405}, "total_tokens": 15048}, "num_turns": 1, "total_cost_usd": 0.002372, "duration_ms": 18396}}
